ation_type": "infinitive", "polarity": "positive"}, "lemma_key": "ambura"}, "interpretation": "Vowel-initial a-stem -ambura (ignite; Hannan [L] M, M-dialect only): Umba yaambura retains vowels. Lemma source_attested; kuambura surface rule_supported via the general ku- + R pattern (Fortune 3.3.15), not verbatim. Finite a|a contacts stay deferred (CT-UNSUP-01).", "language_dialect": "Manyika verified (Hannan M tag); do not assume pan-dialectal.", "lemma_key": "ambura", "morphemes": "ku-ambur-a", "normalization": "Lowercase. No coalescence invented.", "normalized_input": "kuambura -> -ambura", "previously_tested": true, "review_status": "proposed", "round_trip": {"required_reading": {"analysis_type": "infinitive", "lemma": {"lemma_key": "ambura"}, "rule_id": "fortune.verbal.infinitive.001", "slots": {"subject": null, "tense_aspect": null, "polarity": {"value": "positive"}, "object": null, "reflexive": null, "verb_stem": {"surface": "ambura"}, "extensions": []}}}, "scored": true, "source_file": "key_documents/hannan_dictionary.pdf", "source_form": "-ambura [L] M v i Ignite. Umba yaambura", "source_locator": "Hannan p.2"}, {"analyze": {"expected_status": 200, "exhaustive": false, "required_readings": [{"analysis_type": "infinitive", "lemma": {"lemma_key": "enda"}, "rule_id": "fortune.verbal.infinitive.001", "slots": {"subject": null, "tense_aspect": null, "polarity": {"value": "positive"}, "object": null, "reflexive": null, "verb_stem": {"surface": "enda"}, "extensions": []}}], "text": "kuenda"}, "api_scope": "supported", "case_id": "SRC-061", "category": "STEM", "evidence_class": "source_attested", "exhaustive": false, "flows": ["generate", "analyze"], "generate": {"expected_rule_id": "fortune.verbal.infinitive.001", "expected_status": 200, "expected_surface": "kuenda", "features": {"generation_type": "infinitive", "polarity": "positive"}, "lemma_key": "enda"}, "interpretation": "Vowel-initial e-stem -enda (go): ku-enda -> kuenda with no coalescence; imperative Enda! ne